<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Nat'l Refinery 1st half net up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Nat'l Refinery 1st half net up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first half ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		   9,509 vs 7,681</p>
<p>    Profit before tax     276 vs    84</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	152 vs    59</p>
<p>    Interim dividend   15 pct vs   nil per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is National Refinery Ltd. The state-run firm said it carried 152 million rupees unappropriated profit forward to the balance sheet vs a loss of 195 million. Book closure March 17-24. The company paid no dividend for the year ended June 1996. -- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
